# Privacy Policy
Privacy Policy
Privacy Policy

Last updated: June 8, 2026

This privacy policy applies to the Baby Tracker mobile application (the "App") developed by Nous Research.

INFORMATION COLLECTION AND USE

The App operates 100% offline. No data is collected, transmitted, or shared with any servers, third parties, or analytics services. All data you enter — including feeding logs, sleep records, diaper changes, and baby profile information — is stored exclusively on your device using local storage (Capacitor Preferences).

The App does NOT:

- Collect or transmit any personal information
- Use cookies, trackers, or analytics
- Access the internet or any network
- Share data with third parties
- Store data on external servers or cloud services
- Request account registration or login

DATA STORAGE

All app data is saved locally on your device using the device's built-in secure storage. You have full control over your data at all times. You may export your data as CSV from the App's Settings page, or clear all data at any time.

DATA DELETION

To delete all data associated with the App:
- Within the App: Go to Settings > Clear All Data
- Uninstalling the App will also permanently remove all locally stored data

CHILDREN'S PRIVACY

This App is designed for parents and caregivers to track their baby's daily activities. While the App stores information about your baby (name, date of birth, gender), this data never leaves your device. We do not collect personal information from children.

CHANGES TO THIS PRIVACY POLICY

We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Any changes will be reflected in the updated date above. Since the App is fully offline, policy updates are delivered through the App's Settings > About section.

CONTACT

If you have any questions about this privacy policy, please contact us through our support channel at the Google Play Store listing.

NO INTERNET PERMISSION

This App requires no internet access. It is designed to function completely offline, ensuring your family's data remains private and secure on your device.

